{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"remark-api","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remark API"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/highlight/remark"},{"type":"text","value":" handles MDAST code nodes without depending on Remark itself."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"types","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Types"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"remarkcodenode","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RemarkCodeNode"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The supported MDAST input shape: a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"code"},{"type":"text","value":" node with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"value"},{"type":"text","value":", optional "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lang"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"meta"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"remarkhtmlnode","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RemarkHtmlNode"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An MDAST "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"html"},{"type":"text","value":" node with a string "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"value"},{"type":"text","value":" and optional "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"remarkhighlightoptions","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RemarkHighlightOptions"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type RemarkHighlightOptions = {\n  highlighter: Highlighter\n  lineNumbers?: boolean\n  getDecorations?: (node: RemarkCodeNode) =>\n    ReadonlyArray<HighlightDecoration> | undefined\n  getTitle?: (node: RemarkCodeNode) => string | undefined\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Callback decorations are added after fence metadata. A callback title takes precedence over metadata when non-empty."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"remarkhighlightedcodenode","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RemarkHighlightedCodeNode"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The MDAST-compatible result used by the transformer. It has "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"type: 'highlightedCode'"},{"type":"text","value":" and supplies "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"hName"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"hProperties"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"hChildren"},{"type":"text","value":" for "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mdast-util-to-hast"},{"type":"text","value":". Its "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data.syntaxHighlight"},{"type":"text","value":" contains "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"copyText"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lang"},{"type":"text","value":", and optional "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"title"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"functions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Functions"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"remarkcodenodetohtml","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remarkCodeNodeToHtml"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function remarkCodeNodeToHtml(\n  node: RemarkCodeNode,\n  options: RemarkHighlightOptions,\n): RemarkHtmlNode","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Converts one code node to raw highlighted HTML. Use only in pipelines that permit trusted raw HTML output."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"remarkcodenodetomdast","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remarkCodeNodeToMdast"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function remarkCodeNodeToMdast(\n  node: RemarkCodeNode,\n  options: RemarkHighlightOptions,\n): RemarkHighlightedCodeNode","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Converts one code node to an MDAST node carrying HAST fields. Source text and generated attributes are escaped later by the HAST serializer."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"remarkhighlightcodeblocks","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remarkHighlightCodeBlocks"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function remarkHighlightCodeBlocks(\n  options: RemarkHighlightOptions,\n): (tree: unknown) => void","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns a synchronous Remark transformer. It recursively replaces every MDAST "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"code"},{"type":"text","value":" node using "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remarkCodeNodeToMdast"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { remark } from 'remark'\nimport remarkHtml from 'remark-html'\nimport { remarkHighlightCodeBlocks } from '@tanstack/highlight/remark'\n\nconst file = await remark()\n  .use(remarkHighlightCodeBlocks, { highlighter })\n  .use(remarkHtml)\n  .process(markdown)","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See "},{"type":"link","href":"../guides/markdown-pipelines","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Markdown Pipelines"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for pipeline ordering."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"remark-api","text":"Remark API","level":1},{"id":"types","text":"Types","level":2},{"id":"remarkcodenode","text":"RemarkCodeNode","level":3},{"id":"remarkhtmlnode","text":"RemarkHtmlNode","level":3},{"id":"remarkhighlightoptions","text":"RemarkHighlightOptions","level":3},{"id":"remarkhighlightedcodenode","text":"RemarkHighlightedCodeNode","level":3},{"id":"functions","text":"Functions","level":2},{"id":"remarkcodenodetohtml","text":"remarkCodeNodeToHtml","level":3},{"id":"remarkcodenodetomdast","text":"remarkCodeNodeToMdast","level":3},{"id":"remarkhighlightcodeblocks","text":"remarkHighlightCodeBlocks","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Remark API\n\n`@tanstack/highlight/remark` handles MDAST code nodes without depending on Remark itself.\n\n## Types\n\n### `RemarkCodeNode`\n\nThe supported MDAST input shape: a `code` node with `value`, optional `lang`, `meta`, and `data`.\n\n### `RemarkHtmlNode`\n\nAn MDAST `html` node with a string `value` and optional `data`.\n\n### `RemarkHighlightOptions`\n\n```ts\ntype RemarkHighlightOptions = {\n  highlighter: Highlighter\n  lineNumbers?: boolean\n  getDecorations?: (node: RemarkCodeNode) =>\n    ReadonlyArray<HighlightDecoration> | undefined\n  getTitle?: (node: RemarkCodeNode) => string | undefined\n}\n```\n\nCallback decorations are added after fence metadata. A callback title takes precedence over metadata when non-empty.\n\n### `RemarkHighlightedCodeNode`\n\nThe MDAST-compatible result used by the transformer. It has `type: 'highlightedCode'` and supplies `hName`, `hProperties`, and `hChildren` for `mdast-util-to-hast`. Its `data.syntaxHighlight` contains `copyText`, `lang`, and optional `title`.\n\n## Functions\n\n### `remarkCodeNodeToHtml`\n\n```ts\nfunction remarkCodeNodeToHtml(\n  node: RemarkCodeNode,\n  options: RemarkHighlightOptions,\n): RemarkHtmlNode\n```\n\nConverts one code node to raw highlighted HTML. Use only in pipelines that permit trusted raw HTML output.\n\n### `remarkCodeNodeToMdast`\n\n```ts\nfunction remarkCodeNodeToMdast(\n  node: RemarkCodeNode,\n  options: RemarkHighlightOptions,\n): RemarkHighlightedCodeNode\n```\n\nConverts one code node to an MDAST node carrying HAST fields. Source text and generated attributes are escaped later by the HAST serializer.\n\n### `remarkHighlightCodeBlocks`\n\n```ts\nfunction remarkHighlightCodeBlocks(\n  options: RemarkHighlightOptions,\n): (tree: unknown) => void\n```\n\nReturns a synchronous Remark transformer. It recursively replaces every MDAST `code` node using `remarkCodeNodeToMdast`.\n\n```ts\nimport { remark } from 'remark'\nimport remarkHtml from 'remark-html'\nimport { remarkHighlightCodeBlocks } from '@tanstack/highlight/remark'\n\nconst file = await remark()\n  .use(remarkHighlightCodeBlocks, { highlighter })\n  .use(remarkHtml)\n  .process(markdown)\n```\n\nSee [Markdown Pipelines](../guides/markdown-pipelines) for pipeline ordering.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Remark API\n---\n\n# Remark API\n\n`@tanstack/highlight/remark` handles MDAST code nodes without depending on Remark itself.\n\n## Types\n\n### `RemarkCodeNode`\n\nThe supported MDAST input shape: a `code` node with `value`, optional `lang`, `meta`, and `data`.\n\n### `RemarkHtmlNode`\n\nAn MDAST `html` node with a string `value` and optional `data`.\n\n### `RemarkHighlightOptions`\n\n```ts\ntype RemarkHighlightOptions = {\n  highlighter: Highlighter\n  lineNumbers?: boolean\n  getDecorations?: (node: RemarkCodeNode) =>\n    ReadonlyArray<HighlightDecoration> | undefined\n  getTitle?: (node: RemarkCodeNode) => string | undefined\n}\n```\n\nCallback decorations are added after fence metadata. A callback title takes precedence over metadata when non-empty.\n\n### `RemarkHighlightedCodeNode`\n\nThe MDAST-compatible result used by the transformer. It has `type: 'highlightedCode'` and supplies `hName`, `hProperties`, and `hChildren` for `mdast-util-to-hast`. Its `data.syntaxHighlight` contains `copyText`, `lang`, and optional `title`.\n\n## Functions\n\n### `remarkCodeNodeToHtml`\n\n```ts\nfunction remarkCodeNodeToHtml(\n  node: RemarkCodeNode,\n  options: RemarkHighlightOptions,\n): RemarkHtmlNode\n```\n\nConverts one code node to raw highlighted HTML. Use only in pipelines that permit trusted raw HTML output.\n\n### `remarkCodeNodeToMdast`\n\n```ts\nfunction remarkCodeNodeToMdast(\n  node: RemarkCodeNode,\n  options: RemarkHighlightOptions,\n): RemarkHighlightedCodeNode\n```\n\nConverts one code node to an MDAST node carrying HAST fields. Source text and generated attributes are escaped later by the HAST serializer.\n\n### `remarkHighlightCodeBlocks`\n\n```ts\nfunction remarkHighlightCodeBlocks(\n  options: RemarkHighlightOptions,\n): (tree: unknown) => void\n```\n\nReturns a synchronous Remark transformer. It recursively replaces every MDAST `code` node using `remarkCodeNodeToMdast`.\n\n```ts\nimport { remark } from 'remark'\nimport remarkHtml from 'remark-html'\nimport { remarkHighlightCodeBlocks } from '@tanstack/highlight/remark'\n\nconst file = await remark()\n  .use(remarkHighlightCodeBlocks, { highlighter })\n  .use(remarkHtml)\n  .process(markdown)\n```\n\nSee [Markdown Pipelines](../guides/markdown-pipelines) for pipeline ordering.\n"}
